  "post_content": "<p>La biblioteca de Onda homenajea al poeta valenciano Francisco Brines con una exposici&oacute;n, desde este mi&eacute;rcoles hasta el d&iacute;a 30 de abril, con algunos de&nbsp;sus poemas acompa&ntilde;ados de ilustraciones de Jos&eacute; Vergara Peris.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/04/IMG_6027.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Los&nbsp;carteles est&aacute;n en las esquinas de las estanter&iacute;as de los libros de pr&eacute;stamo, entre el mostrador y las cabinas de estudio. All&iacute; se pueden leer con detenimiento los&nbsp;poemas bajo el t&iacute;tulo Apunte de viaje, de Francisco Brines, nacido en Oliva y que ocupa el sill&oacute;n X de la Real Academia Espa&ntilde;ola.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscobrinesbibliotecaonda/img_6027.jpg\" alt=\"img_6027\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscobrinesbibliotecaonda/img_6028.jpg\" alt=\"img_6028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscobrinesbibliotecaonda/img_6029.jpg\" alt=\"img_6029\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscobrinesbibliotecaonda/img_6030.jpg\" alt=\"img_6030\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscobrinesbibliotecaonda/img_6031.jpg\" alt=\"img_6031\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscobrinesbibliotecaonda/img_6032.jpg\" alt=\"img_6032\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscobrinesbibliotecaonda/img_6033.jpg\" alt=\"img_6033\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscobrinesbibliotecaonda/img_6034.jpg\" alt=\"img_6034\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscobrinesbibliotecaonda/img_6035.jpg\" alt=\"img_6035\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscobrinesbibliotecaonda/img_6036.jpg\" alt=\"img_6036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscobrinesbibliotecaonda/img_6037.jpg\" alt=\"img_6037\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofranciscobrinesbibliotecaonda/img_6038.jpg\" alt=\"img_6038\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
